        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631-a2">

                <pb facs="0752" n="666" xml:id="pg666"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Clayton to Mr.
                            Light, consular agent at
                        Guadalajara.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Wire me if the murderer of John E. Week has been apprehended.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell Clayton.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
